note defect_keyword_prefix: known defect at the pin. A function name longer than 8 bytes whose first
note 8 bytes are an 8-letter keyword (continue, truncate, sockname, execprog, peercred) is refused error 16.
note Workaround: rename (cont_x, trunc_num). Expected to change when the compiler fix is pinned
fn continue_x to int
ret 7
end
fn main to int
ret continue_x
end
